 {"file_name": "Screenshot_03.png", "id": "750887156432789", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001724_750887159766122_1493923655041025906_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z-6rpyPHosEQ7kNvwGGiDtV&_nc_oc=AdoS_hCiisFcYP_Te-qhhcOWSNk1bJhS4NotrUZhFWtbAgGmN3hLfxS0azUIsAjWyZ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEvzp8tI1_GzAKa8D96cfDz85ygTUOo2G3NrUwZ3bPZ6A&oe=6A9749B7"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_04.png", "id": "911467930162886", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003243_911467933496219_5018844149446080143_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BznirMnxFGAQ7kNvwH7hf_V&_nc_oc=AdrFJByk6PHR2lkzBa-zHdXld4NtMMICt2bA6xsreyfyy3yH4wKolGFfos5VpXPFL_c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEQPza9vSj9GGJnBFMnDQG7j4YV_7bJcZUELBmllhabmw&oe=6A974981"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_05.png", "id": "174155445030577", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75222945_174155448363910_8892028513575383207_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Hk7unqvc_5UQ7kNvwEYHzaW&_nc_oc=Adq1H7U1h8g5FaXxPJ3mcjwoIEUqlNy8hlTngCZ60fl2rByh3o10bpKWdt5l1xF1HAI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFTOxK7iO1iPR3US3ret1DHEQ3wAa-nnpXbi2O3ACRsVw&oe=6A974091"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverShot_Sky.png", "id": "757988159035053", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974736_757988162368386_3128866040929659758_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=whUJBUs0HjAQ7kNvwEKnGJ5&_nc_oc=AdqH8qjM-eenYy1OUbsYBpzDv7-bQ4wdOfQKC6icBgs9S4G87S4nEPaMwHod3PSDzNU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGmvx8hewETcdBIQsgCNOVjhUedI3uxx9AE8bUQvDBDWg&oe=6A972961"}, "display_name": "Sky Squadron", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Think you\u2019ve got what it takes to keep Australia\u2019s skies safe?\n\nThe tropical island paradise is being invaded, and only hot-shot Keith Koala can jump into the gunner\u2019s seat and fend off some of the most menacing meanies that the Aussie Islands have ever seen! Grab the controls hands-on to blow fearsome foes out of the sky in thrilling aerial combat before they plunder everything your home has to offer.\n\nFeatures\n- An Australian take on the beloved \u201cStar Fox\u201d rail shooter formula, combined with thrilling WW2 gunner gameplay.\n- Experience a koala-ty cast of Aussie animals fighting to survive against invasive enemies!\n- Use devastating powerups to take those drongos down! \n- Blast through every mission alongside your friends in seamless online co-op.\n- Branching missions & varied objectives. \n- Tear apart foul foes piece by piece\u2026 literally! With dynamic and fully destructible bosses.\n- Dominate the skies and claim your rightful position as an apex species with global leaderboards available for every single mission.", "short_description": "Jump in the bloomin' gunner seat as Keith Koala to save your mates & their island paradise from the evil invading empire! Sky Squadron offers a unique Aussie twist on shooter classics like Star Fox and Panzer Dragoon, while adding thrilling & immersive VR gunner gameplay."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vTsVR5zvtVSLBBmnyuJCb-8vKqFCG-v4egtNg28sD4SLsCwkJ3DAw8CC41bEaKPMxi0wxDfMeQYD9ee/pub", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Trick Shot Development", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.trickshotdev.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "ARCADE", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOV